{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pdtGraceSeconds","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A session is normally started before the content player has loaded its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"source, so the scheduler’s first ticks see no PDT even on a stream that does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carry it. Those ticks make no scheduling decision, rather than matching breaks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the system clock — which runs ahead of the live playhead by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream’s latency and would fire a break early (PLAYG-360).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"backstop, not a fixed delay"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". The SDK stops waiting at whichever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes first: content has been playing for ~1s and still exposes no PDT (direct","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence about the stream — ","type":"text"},{"code":"DA-PDT-MISSING","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is emitted once and the clock","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes over immediately, so a join-in-progress break is not delayed below the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tune-in minimum), or this window elapses (the backstop for a player that never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"starts).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to fall back to the system clock immediately. Has no effect on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"pts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"-timebase manifests. Mirrors the web ","type":"text"},{"code":"pdtGraceSeconds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig\/pdtgraceseconds"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsSDK"}],"title":"pdtGraceSeconds","externalID":"s:14OptiViewAdsSDK0abC6ConfigV15pdtGraceSecondsSdvp","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pdtGraceSeconds","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK","doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long, in seconds, to wait for the stream’s "},{"code":"EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"wallclock","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase session before concluding the stream carries none."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig\/pdtGraceSeconds"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAds":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OptiViewAds","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewads","title":"OptiViewAds","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAds","abstract":